      "customfield_10012" : "0|i002o7:",
      "customfield_10300" : "{}",
      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "void    Thread::AbortAndWaitForDone (Time:",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "attrs" : {
                        "id" : "1f603",
                        "shortName" : ":smiley:",
                        "text" : "😃"
                     },
                     "type" : "emoji"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "urationSecondsType timeout)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "{",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "Time:",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "attrs" : {
                        "id" : "1f603",
                        "shortName" : ":smiley:",
                        "text" : "😃"
                     },
                     "type" : "emoji"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "urationSecondsType   endTime =   Time::GetTickCount () + timeout;",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "// an abort may need to be resent (since there could be a race and we may need to force wakeup again)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "unsigned int tries = 0;",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "while (true) {",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "const   Time:",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "attrs" : {
                        "id" : "1f603",
                        "shortName" : ":smiley:",
                        "text" : "😃"
                     },
                     "type" : "emoji"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "urationSecondsType   kTimeBetweenAborts_     =   1.0f;",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "Abort ();",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "tries++;",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "Time:",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "attrs" : {
                        "id" : "1f603",
                        "shortName" : ":smiley:",
                        "text" : "😃"
                     },
                     "type" : "emoji"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "urationSecondsType   timeLeft    =   endTime - Time::GetTickCount ();",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "if (timeLeft <= kTimeBetweenAborts_) {",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "WaitForDone (timeLeft);     // throws if we should throw",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "return;",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "}",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Alot of ways to do ebtter. If there was a safe way to wait without busy waiting fine.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "But in meantime - at least dont use 1 second - use a sliding scale - .1, .2, ... up to maybe 1 or 10 seconds...",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
